{"_id":"post.why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn","_type":"post","title":"Why we are starting with GBP-to-NGN","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn"},"category":"Send Money Home","summary":"GreenCard is starting with one job: make GBP-funded transfers to recipients in Nigeria receiving NGN feel clearer.","publishedAt":"2026-06-24T00:00:00.000Z","readTime":"3 min read","label":"Launch note","body":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-heading-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-heading-span-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"One corridor first"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-0-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-span-0-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"We could talk about a lot of future products, but that is not what this launch is about."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-0-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-span-0-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The first version of GreenCard is focused on GBP-to-NGN transfers. You fund in GBP. Your recipient gets Naira in Nigeria."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-heading-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-heading-span-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Why narrow is better"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-1-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-span-1-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"A narrow launch lets us pay attention to the parts that actually matter: clear rates, fees you can see, correct recipient details, and useful support when something needs checking."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-1-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-span-1-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"It also keeps the product honest. We want the website to match what customers can actually use today."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-heading-2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-heading-span-2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"What comes next"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-2-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-span-2-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Other features may come later, but they should not distract from the first promise."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-2-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-are-starting-with-gbp-to-ngn-paragraph-span-2-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"For now, the goal is simple: make GBP-funded transfers to recipients in Nigeria feel clearer, safer, and easier to follow."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}]}
{"_id":"post.three-things-to-check-before-sending","_type":"post","title":"Three things to check before sending money home","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"three-things-to-check-before-sending"},"category":"Send Money Home","summary":"A short checklist for avoiding the small mistakes that can slow down a transfer.","publishedAt":"2026-06-20T00:00:00.000Z","readTime":"2 min read","label":"Checklist","body":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-heading-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-heading-span-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Check the recipient name"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-0-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-span-0-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Most transfer problems start with small details. A missing middle name, a typo, or the wrong bank detail can turn a quick payment into a support case."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-0-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-span-0-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Before you confirm, slow down for ten seconds and check the recipient name exactly as it should appear."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-heading-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-heading-span-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Check the Naira amount"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-1-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-span-1-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Do not only look at the GBP amount you are sending. Look at the amount expected to arrive in Nigeria."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-1-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-span-1-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"That final Naira payout is usually the number your family or friend is planning around."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-heading-2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-heading-span-2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Check the fee"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-2-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-span-2-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"A good transfer screen should make the fee visible before you pay."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-2-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"three-things-to-check-before-sending-paragraph-span-2-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"If you can see the rate, the fee, and the expected payout in one place, it is easier to decide whether the transfer works for you."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}]}
{"_id":"post.rates-are-not-the-whole-story","_type":"post","title":"Rates are not the whole story","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story"},"category":"Rates and Fees","summary":"A strong exchange rate matters, but the final payout and fee visibility matter too.","publishedAt":"2026-06-17T00:00:00.000Z","readTime":"3 min read","label":"Rates","body":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-heading-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-heading-span-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The headline rate can distract you"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-0-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-span-0-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"It is easy to compare services by exchange rate alone. That is useful, but it is not the whole picture."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-0-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-span-0-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"A transfer can show a nice-looking rate and still feel unclear if the fee is hidden or the final payout changes too late."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-heading-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-heading-span-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Start from the payout"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-1-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-span-1-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"For GBP-funded transfers to Nigeria, the practical question is simple: how much Naira will arrive?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-1-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-span-1-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"That is why GreenCard is being shaped around showing the rate, fee, and expected payout before you confirm."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-heading-2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-heading-span-2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Clear beats clever"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-2-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-span-2-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"People should not need a spreadsheet to understand a money transfer."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-2-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"rates-are-not-the-whole-story-paragraph-span-2-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The cleaner the breakdown, the easier it is to trust what you are sending."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}]}
{"_id":"post.why-we-ask-for-id","_type":"post","title":"Why we ask for ID before you send","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"why-we-ask-for-id"},"category":"Safety","summary":"Identity checks can feel annoying, but they help protect the transfer flow.","publishedAt":"2026-06-12T00:00:00.000Z","readTime":"3 min read","label":"Safety","body":[{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-heading-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-heading-span-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"It is not just a formality"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-paragraph-0-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-paragraph-span-0-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"When money moves across borders, the sender has to be verified. That protects customers, recipients, and the partners who help process the payment."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-paragraph-0-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-paragraph-span-0-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"It also makes support easier. If a transfer needs review, accurate account information helps the team understand what happened."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-heading-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-heading-span-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"What to have ready"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-paragraph-1-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-paragraph-span-1-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Use your real name, correct date of birth, current address, and a valid ID document."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-paragraph-1-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"why-we-ask-for-id-paragraph-span-1-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"It is better to get this right once than to fix it in the middle of an urgent transfer."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}]}
{"_id":"post.what-happens-after-you-press-send","_type":"post","title":"What happens after you press send?","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"what-happens-after-you-press-send"},"category":"Nigeria Payouts","summary":"The transfer does not end when you pay in GBP. Here is what customers should be able to follow.","publishedAt":"2026-06-09T00:00:00.000Z","readTime":"3 min read","label":"Payout","body":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-heading-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-heading-span-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Your payment is confirmed"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-0-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-span-0-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The first step is confirming that your GBP payment has been received."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-0-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-span-0-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"After that, the transfer can move through processing and payout steps before the recipient gets Naira."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-heading-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-heading-span-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Status matters"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-1-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-span-1-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"A sender should not be left guessing. Clear status updates help you know whether a transfer is processing, completed, or needs attention."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-1-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-span-1-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"That is especially important when the money is for rent, school fees, healthcare, or family support."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-heading-2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-heading-span-2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Support should have context"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-2-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-span-2-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"If you contact support, you should not have to explain the entire transfer from scratch."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-2-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"what-happens-after-you-press-send-paragraph-span-2-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Good tracking gives the support team the details they need to help faster."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}]}
{"_id":"post.helping-family-without-guesswork","_type":"post","title":"Helping family without guesswork","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"helping-family-without-guesswork"},"category":"Family Support","summary":"For many people, sending money home is not occasional. It is part of how family life works.","publishedAt":"2026-06-05T00:00:00.000Z","readTime":"2 min read","label":"Family","body":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-heading-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-heading-span-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Know what the money is for"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-0-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-span-0-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"School fees, hospital bills, groceries, repairs, rent, a younger sibling's allowance. The reason matters because the timing matters."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-0-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-span-0-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"When the purpose is clear, it is easier to decide how much to send and when to send it."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-heading-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-heading-span-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Keep the regular details close"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-1-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-span-1-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"If you send to the same person often, keep their correct bank details somewhere safe."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-1-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-span-1-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"That small habit can save time when someone needs money quickly."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-heading-2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-heading-span-2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Leave room for the unexpected"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-2-0","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-span-2-0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Family support is rarely perfectly scheduled. Something always comes up."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-2-1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"helping-family-without-guesswork-paragraph-span-2-1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The best transfer experience is one that makes the basics clear when you are already dealing with pressure."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}]}
